This file follows the EICAR test-file convention: it contains a
DELIBERATE, harmless, fake test string that a scanner must detect to
prove the scanner itself is working. Here the scanner is the publish
gate's label scan, and the property being proven is that the scan
reaches files inside dot-directories (such as this one). The string
below is fake; no real work item with that number exists anywhere.

If a publish-gate scan run does NOT show a hit on the decoy line
